sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant M as MON
  participant O as OSD
  C->>M: authentication request (user name)
  M-->>C: challenge encrypted with the shared key
  C->>M: correct answer to the challenge
  M-->>C: session key + ticket with an expiry
  C->>O: I/O request with the ticket
  O->>O: check the ticket with the service key (no MON contact)
  O-->>C: reply
